        "TileImage": "$($repository df5c1078-aa9e-4649-b5a4-e49ec984cc89).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome back to Sapienza 47. Today we have an experimental poison that the first target of the day, Stefano Derose is trying to sell to the second target of the day Paciano Panzarella. I dont know the exact need for their goal, but they plan to research and strengthen the poison to be invincible. The poisons researcher and future host Geraldo Delucci is preparing a laboratory in secret caves. It seems like the first targets are unsure of each other&apos;s location. I recommend a sniper 47. Have fun!",
